# Daily Bugle Building: "{T}: Add {C}." and "{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color." On turn 1 Bot1 plays it and taps it for {C}; on turn 3 it pays {1} with Mox Emerald and taps it for
# {R}: one mana of the chosen color, the {G} spent on the cost.

[Bot1 Deck]
Daily Bugle Building
Mox Emerald
Plains x5
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Daily Bugle Building.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Daily Bugle Building.Activate(Ability: Add {C})
? Bot1.Mana = {C}
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Daily Bugle Building.Activate(Ability: {1}; Color: Red)
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
? Bot1.Mana = {R}

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Daily Bugle Building.Tapped = true
